      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 / 链事实与合约状态\n充值 Transfer / 成功原生 trace\nSweep/Lot/Settlement/Withdrawal\nDisposition / Hold / Reserve / 控制事件\noperationStatus / requestStatus 交叉核验",
      "originalText": "1 / 链事实与合约状态\n充值 Transfer / 成功原生 trace\nSweep/Lot/Settlement/Withdrawal\nDisposition / Hold / Reserve / 控制事件\noperationStatus / requestStatus 交叉核验",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-chain",
