      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "7 / 查询接口（规划）\nGET deposits / balances / withdrawals\n链确认 + 风险 + 入账/业务状态\nledger_seq / 规范高度与快照\n不得暴露其他租户或调查材料",
      "originalText": "7 / 查询接口（规划）\nGET deposits / balances / withdrawals\n链确认 + 风险 + 入账/业务状态\nledger_seq / 规范高度与快照\n不得暴露其他租户或调查材料",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-query",
      "autoResize": false,
