      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-reorg-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 249.0,
      "y": 1530.0,
      "width": 342,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3820885,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "重组与最终性故障\n旧观测先撤销有效性，再激活新规范事件。\n重新打包可能改变日志索引/结果。\n控制重组时本地 gate 不恢复。\n深重组用受审查 journal 冲正 cycle，\n不改历史分录、不直接改用户余额。\n缺口形成风险敞口；查询明确不确定。\n不凭服务器时钟判定签名过期。",
      "originalText": "重组与最终性故障\n旧观测先撤销有效性，再激活新规范事件。\n重新打包可能改变日志索引/结果。\n控制重组时本地 gate 不恢复。\n深重组用受审查 journal 冲正 cycle，\n不改历史分录、不直接改用户余额。\n缺口形成风险敞口；查询明确不确定。\n不凭服务器时钟判定签名过期。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-reorg",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-recovery",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 860,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#e03131",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff0f0",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3663583,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-recovery-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-recovery-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1034.15,
      "y": 1530.0,
      "width": 371.7,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4147141,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "旧 PG / 故障恢复\n先进入 RECOVERY_LOCKED。\n恢复发行映射、证据、签名和配置版本。\n从可靠共同 checkpoint 回放 logs/trace。\n核验每个域的已消费/取消请求和终态。\n对账通过前不开放新地址/出金。\n链日志没有完整用户归属和链下批准，\n不能仅靠区块重建全部平台事实。",
      "originalText": "旧 PG / 故障恢复\n先进入 RECOVERY_LOCKED。\n恢复发行映射、证据、签名和配置版本。\n从可靠共同 checkpoint 回放 logs/trace。\n核验每个域的已消费/取消请求和终态。\n对账通过前不开放新地址/出金。\n链日志没有完整用户归属和链下批准，\n不能仅靠区块重建全部平台事实。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-recovery",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-checkpoint",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 1660,
      "y": 1450,
      "width": 720,
      "height": 340,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#0c8599",
      "backgroundColor": "#e3fafc",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 3843218,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-checkpoint-text",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ],
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-checkpoint-text",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1807.15,
      "y": 1530.0,
      "width": 425.7,
      "height": 180.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 4326776,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 0,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791687049636,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "联合 checkpoint 与数值约束\nchain height/hash + 覆盖水位\nregistry/config version + ledger_seq\n比较所有池/Vault/Relayer 的同资产快照。\n链金额 U256；PG NUMERIC 显式整数/上界 CHECK。\n金额/手续费/Gas按各自资产独立凭证。\n链/RPC/KYT/签名在短 PG 事务外执行，\n返回后 CAS 版本重校验。",
      "originalText": "联合 checkpoint 与数值约束\nchain height/hash + 覆盖水位\nregistry/config version + ledger_seq\n比较所有池/Vault/Relayer 的同资产快照。\n链金额 U256；PG NUMERIC 显式整数/上界 CHECK。\n金额/手续费/Gas按各自资产独立凭证。\n链/RPC/KYT/签名在短 PG 事务外执行，\n返回后 CAS 版本重校验。",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-checkpoint",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "20261011-09-events-ledger-recovery-note0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1990,
      "width": 2320,
      "height": 115,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
